    "date": 1728540936,
    "caption": "We had an incredible weekend at the NASA Space Apps Challenge, organized by American Corner and Makerspace Oral on October 5th and 6th, 2024! 🚀✨\n\nWith 80 participants across 16 teams, this two-day hackathon was filled with innovation, creativity, and boundless energy. 💡💪 The teams dedicated themselves to tackling global challenges, showcasing their technological skills and problem-solving abilities.\n\nA big thank you to our fantastic mentors, judges, and volunteers, as well as the outstanding participants who made this event a success. 🙌 Your commitment and enthusiasm were truly inspiring!\n\nStay tuned for more exciting events, and thank you for being part of this unforgettable experience! 🌟\n\n@usinkz \n\n#SpaceAppsOral #usinkz",
